data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"call_1509648b6cda46748ca0571a","messageId":"dfeb4677-cc96-44ff-bb2a-1021176cc0df","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"59c94751aad6e7f3db824614fc9732efc2bf1036a2c36b0885cc14a735d60a76\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"title\":\"主题与多语言\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/plugin-api.md\",\"summary\":\"项目插件由能力声明、组件和可选的服务生命周期组成。创建文件与注册步骤见创建自定义插件。修改已有官方插件外观时，先使用组件公开属性。\",\"sha256\":\"cd30e68bc788dd22fdccc937313217ed5e3c3816b86e84f9138f758709423720\",\"sectionId\":\"s423\",\"offset\":0,\"totalCharacters\":784,\"content\":\"## 主题与多语言\\n\\n组件优先使用工程已有的 UI 库和公开样式属性，主题颜色沿用项目的 CSS 变量。官方文案通过 `@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins` 的 `useAgentUILocale()` 读取，项目通过 `Agent` 的 `locales` 属性覆盖需要修改的键。\\n\\n本页工单操作示例使用自己的业务文案。按需创建 `services/ticket-messages.ts`，读取同一个语言上下文：\\n\\n```ts\\nimport { useAgentUILocaleCode } from '@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins';\\n\\nconst messages = {\\n  'zh-CN': {\\n    send: '分析工单',\\n    prompt: '请分析当前工单并给出处理建议。',\\n    failed: '请求失败，请稍后重试。',\\n  },\\n  'en-US': {\\n    send: 'Analyze ticket',\\n    prompt: 'Analyze the current ticket and suggest next steps.',\\n    failed: 'The request failed. Please try again.',\\n  },\\n};\\nexport function useTicketActionsMessages() {\\n  return messages[useAgentUILocaleCode()];\\n}\\n```\\n\\n业务文案由项目维护，不增加独立语言状态。两种语言保持字段一致；协议名、服务名、插件 ID 和消息名保持原值。主题变量与检查方式见[样式与文案开发](/development/styling-and-localization.md)。\\n\\n\",\"nextOffset\":null}}","role":"tool"}

